      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "IDEN LADY LINCOLN (3) has been coming from back row draws of late, racing parked but fighting on for second here two back then finishing midfield last start. Race fit now and should get every chance from the more favourable draw. MOVESLIKEALADY (9) gave a good account at her latest appearance at Launceston, coming from this row to be beaten just 2.5 metres to continue a run of top-four results. Can make an impact again. BAIL DENIED (2) was down the track from a standing start last time but had recorded two wins and a placing from the previous three runs when behind a mobile so is suited returning to those conditions. ROCKNALLOVERTHEWORLD NZ (1) gets the ace draw and must be considered after he finished runner-up at Launceston six days ago.",
